  "question": {
    "text": "The first ionization enthalpies of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Be</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> follow the order",
